Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Commit frontend project files; fix unused variable

- .gitignore: the global *.json / *.html rules hid package.json,
  tsconfig.json and index.html, so a fresh clone could not build the
  frontend. Re-include them; ignore tsconfig.tsbuildinfo.
- Right.tsx: drop a variable left unused by the save refactor
  (noUnusedLocals failed `pnpm build`).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DLvEwCHn5XK6jH4s6BTiCE
